---

<section class="machine-section" id="the-machine">
  <!-- Blue exposé block -->
  <div class="machine-expose">
    <div class="machine-expose-bg">
      <div class="machine-expose-pattern"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container machine-expose-content">
      <span class="machine-expose-label animate-in" data-i18n="machine.expose_label">Know the Playbook</span>
      <h2 class="machine-expose-headline animate-in" data-i18n="machine.expose_headline">The Machine</h2>

      <!-- Core Thesis -->
      <div class="thesis-block animate-in">
        <p class="thesis-text" data-i18n="machine.thesis">
          "Democracy cannot be preserved nationally if it is subverted locally."
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- National Pattern Timeline -->
      <div class="timeline-section animate-in">
        <h3 class="timeline-title" data-i18n="machine.timeline_title">How They Hold a Ward</h3>
        <p class="timeline-intro" data-i18n="machine.timeline_intro">
          A machine ward is not held by good work. It is held by four habits, and the 25th Ward lived under all of them.
        </p>

        <div class="timeline">
          <div class="timeline-item animate-in">
            <div class="timeline-year" data-i18n="machine.pattern_1_label">Developer money</div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p data-i18n="machine.pattern_1">Campaign accounts filled by developers and corporate PACs, so the votes at City Hall answer to the people who wrote the checks instead of the people on the block.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item animate-in">
            <div class="timeline-year" data-i18n="machine.pattern_2_label">Backroom zoning</div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p data-i18n="machine.pattern_2">One alderman deciding what gets built, behind a closed door, with neighbors told after the permits are already pulled.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item animate-in">
            <div class="timeline-year" data-i18n="machine.pattern_3_label">Your money, their lawyers</div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p data-i18n="machine.pattern_3">The Chicago Tribune reported in 2023 that Danny Solis spent $220,000 from his campaign fund on criminal defense lawyers during the federal probe at City Hall. Byron took it all the way to the Illinois Supreme Court, which condemned the corruption and ruled that only the legislature can ban the practice.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="timeline-item timeline-item-now animate-in">
            <div class="timeline-year" data-i18n="machine.pattern_4_label">Ballot objections</div>
            <div class="timeline-content">
              <p data-i18n="machine.pattern_4">And when the votes are not there, the lawyers are. This summer their objections kept Byron's name off a congressional ballot. A ward is a different story: here they have to beat him in front of the neighbors.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .machine-expose {
    position: relative;
    padding: var(--space-4xl) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .machine-expose-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: var(--blue);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .machine-expose-pattern {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    opacity: 0.04;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(
        -45deg,
        transparent,
        transparent 30px,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 30px,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 31px
      );
  }

  .machine-expose-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .machine-expose-label {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--gold-soft);
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .machine-expose-headline {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-4xl);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--cream);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  /* Subversion Block */
  .subversion-block {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .subversion-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .subversion-text {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .subversion-text:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Thesis Block */
  .thesis-block {
    text-align: center;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-xl);
    margin: var(--space-3xl) 0;
    border-top: 2px solid rgba(251, 226, 186, 0.15);
    border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(251, 226, 186, 0.15);
  }

  .thesis-text {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Timeline */
  .timeline-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-2xl);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .timeline-intro {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .timeline {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 36px;
  }

  .timeline::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--gold-soft), rgba(251, 226, 186, 0.2));
  }

  .timeline-item {
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .timeline-item:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .timeline-item::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -30px;
    top: 6px;
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    background: var(--gold-soft);
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 2px solid var(--blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245, 208, 138, 0.3);
  }

  .timeline-item-now::before {
    background: var(--orange);
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    left: -31px;
    top: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(230, 136, 28, 0.3);
    animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite;
  }

  @keyframes pulse-dot {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(230, 136, 28, 0.3); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(230, 136, 28, 0.1); }
  }

  .timeline-year {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--gold-soft);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .timeline-item-now .timeline-year {
    color: var(--orange);
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
  }

  .timeline-content p {
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .machine-expose-headline {
      font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    }

    .thesis-text {
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
    }
  }
</style>
